     A** WORKERS' COMP EMPLOYER MASTER FILE
      *****************************************************************
      *  SPECIAL FILE NOTES:                                          *
      *                                                               *
      *  THE FOLLOWING FILES/PROGRAMS MUST BE MODIFIED ANYTIME A NEW  *
      *  FIELD IS ADDED TO WMEMP:                                     *
      *                                                               *
      *  - ANY FIELD THAT IS ADDED TO THIS FILE MUST ALSO BE ADDED    *
      *    TO THE VERSION OF WMEMP IN THE QUOTE LIBRARY               *
      *                                                               *
      *  - NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES (WMEMP/     *
      *    WMEMP) IN THE MONTHEND LIBRARY AT CLIENT SITE              *
      *    MAKE NOTE ON INSTALL SHEETS                                *
      *                                                               *
      *  - NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES (WMEMP/     *
      *    WMEMP) IN THE TEST ENVIRONMENT AT CLIENT SITE              *
      *    MAKE NOTE ON INSTALL SHEETS                                *
      *                                                               *
      *  - EMPLOYER MASTER MAINTENANCE WILL NEED TO BE MODIFIED       *
      *    TO ALLOW INPUT INTO THE NEW FIELD SO THAT THE USER CAN     *
      *    ASSIGN THE FIELD A VALUE                                   *
      *                                                               *
      *  - RECOMPILE QUOTE TRANSFER PROGRAM (W8700R)                  *
      *                                                               *
      *  - AUDIT BILL CHANGES (W7720R, W7700R)                        *
      *                                                               *
      *  - ORIGINAL/REVISED BILL CHANGES (W8010R, W7610/20R)          *
      *                                                               *
      *  - DAILY BATCH PGM (W6000C) MAY REFER TO WMEMP IN BASE (WFIL) *
      *    SPECIFICALLY IN ANY CPYF FOR MONTHEND,  IF A CLIENT        *
      *    VERSION IS BEING CREATED CPYF MUST BE CHANGED              *
      *    ACCORDINGLY                                                *
      *                                                               *
      *  - CHANGE OVRDBF COMMANDS IN QUOTE TRANSFER OVERRIDE PGM      *
      *    (W8700C) TO REFER TO CHANGED FILE IN CORRECT LIBRARY       *
      *                                                               *
      *****************************************************************
